      <div class="pack-card fade-in">
        <h4 class="pack-title">Thin Air</h4>
        <p class="pack-desc">Tension &amp; dialog music. The sound of something about to break.</p>
        <ul class="pack-details">
          <li>20 original compositions in 3 formats (WAV · OGG · MP3)</li>
